  "metadata": {
    "resource_type": "software",
    "title": "ADHTEB",
    "description": "ADHTEB (Alzheimer's Disease Harmonization Text Embedding Benchmark) is a Python package designed to evaluate the performance of text-embedding models in harmonizing variable descriptions from diverse cohorts in the context of Alzheimer's disease.\nAs general purpose benchmarks often lack domain-specific evaluation for clinical data, this benchmark is specifically designed to evaluate the performance of embedding models for harmonization or clustering of data descriptions in a clinical setting.",
